msgid "Cross borders in pursuit of truth;"
msgstr "境を越えて真を求め、"

#. Global message key: motto2
#: src/sections/traditions.html:6
msgctxt "text:motto2"
msgid "contest ideas with respect."
msgstr "礼をもって競い合う。"

#. Global message key: mottoBody
#: src/sections/about.html:21
msgctxt "text:mottoBody"
msgid "Bring back observations others can check. Leave the crossing safe for whoever follows."
msgstr "確かめられる記録を持ち帰り、次に通る人の道を残す。それが本学の越境です。"

